<title>ITALY: Gross yield 6.09 pct on 3-month Italian T-bills.</title>
<headline>Gross yield 6.09 pct on 3-month Italian T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for the sale of 14.0 trillion lire of three, six and 12-month short-term Treasury bills (BOTs).</p>
<p>		 Gross yield  (last)    Avge price   (last)</p>
<p>    3-month     6.09	(6.95)    98.52	  (98.37)</p>
<p>    6-month     6.56	(6.73)    96.85	  (96.77)</p>
<p>    1-year	6.52	(6.57)    93.85	  (93.85)</p>
<p>Note: results compared with a previous auction on January 28.</p>
</text>
